WEBVTT

01:36.650 --> 01:39.820
Pathetic, Fujikido.

01:39.820 --> 01:41.740
If you'd only left things to me,

01:41.740 --> 01:46.830
you would be holding your enemy's still-beating heart in your hands right now.

01:47.210 --> 01:48.500
Help me!

01:48.830 --> 01:51.840
I will help you as much as you like.

01:51.840 --> 01:55.420
If you'd left things to me sooner...

01:55.420 --> 01:57.550
I will not leave things to you.

01:57.550 --> 02:00.640
Just help me. For my own sake!

02:00.640 --> 02:03.100
How selfish.

02:03.100 --> 02:08.480
Truly selfish! It's unacceptable, Fujikido.

02:08.480 --> 02:11.060
I will make you accept it!

02:12.480 --> 02:14.320
You...

02:14.610 --> 02:16.940
YEEART!

02:22.320 --> 02:23.870
I see.

02:23.870 --> 02:25.580
It worked?

02:27.830 --> 02:30.000
Ah, good. You're awake—

02:38.170 --> 02:40.510
AIYEARRRrrgghhh...

02:40.510 --> 02:42.390
How long was I asleep?

02:43.010 --> 02:46.890
A full day. You were asleep just a moment ago.

02:47.310 --> 02:49.640
It is now the witching hour...

02:49.640 --> 02:50.980
A full day, huh?

02:50.980 --> 02:57.110
Announcing his candidacy just before the deadline,
Laomoto Khan made the following comments.

02:55.520 --> 02:57.110
The race for governor...

02:58.490 --> 03:02.490
I have, from a purely economic standpoint,

03:02.490 --> 03:08.200
been one of the biggest backers of Neo-Saitama's development so far.

03:09.040 --> 03:12.420
I regret to say it, but I've repeatedly declined requests

03:12.420 --> 03:15.960
from those around me to go into politics.

03:15.960 --> 03:19.090
You're leaving, aren't you? Right now?

03:20.010 --> 03:21.800
Right now.

03:21.800 --> 03:23.760
Agata-SAN, I'm sorry.

03:24.220 --> 03:25.800
Don't apologize.

03:25.800 --> 03:28.810
I should be thanking you.

03:29.390 --> 03:34.270
I don't know anything about you, so maybe I shouldn't say this.

03:34.270 --> 03:35.980
But be careful, please.

04:02.470 --> 04:03.340
YEEART!

04:14.900 --> 04:16.690
This is the first floor.

04:16.690 --> 04:18.480
Screw you, asshole!

04:21.990 --> 04:24.150
MWAHAHAHA!

04:24.150 --> 04:28.620
I'm surprised you had the guts to show up, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

04:28.620 --> 04:33.410
You must be quite taken with that Caucasoid woman.

04:33.410 --> 04:36.000
And by "taken with," I mean you must take her... <i>in bed!</i>

04:40.250 --> 04:43.010
DŌMO, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

04:43.010 --> 04:46.640
I am The Voice of Laomoto.

04:47.590 --> 04:48.260
DŌMO.

04:48.930 --> 04:51.100
I am NINJA Slayer.

04:55.810 --> 05:00.320
I have a wonderful message for you from my boss.

05:00.320 --> 05:05.900
Get on your knees and DOGEZA, and swear your loyalty to the SŌKAI SYNDICATE.

05:00.320 --> 05:05.900
NOTE: DOGEZA is the dishonorable act of typing "m(_ _)m".

05:05.900 --> 05:13.160
My boss is a swell guy, so he'll let you join the SIX GATES and keep all your fingers!

05:13.160 --> 05:14.160
YEEART!

05:14.410 --> 05:14.910
Knock that off!

05:14.910 --> 05:15.830
GWARGH!

05:16.210 --> 05:22.130
So you're a rabid dog who won't even negotiate?

05:22.130 --> 05:28.680
I bet you were doing it doggy-style with that Nancy girl... <i>in bed!</i>

05:30.470 --> 05:33.890
Oh, don't worry.

05:33.890 --> 05:37.140
Right now, that Caucasoid woman's body

05:37.140 --> 05:42.940
is at the tender mercies of Laomoto-SAN!

05:43.360 --> 05:48.360
I'm sure she'll go crazy and start spilling every secret she knows... <i>in bed!</i>

05:48.360 --> 05:49.200
YEEART!

05:49.200 --> 05:49.780
AIYEARGH!

05:49.780 --> 05:51.240
GWARGH!

05:52.240 --> 05:56.870
If you won't DOGEZA,
then you'll die a painful death!

05:56.870 --> 05:58.080
Get him!

05:58.830 --> 06:01.460
Screw you, asshole!

06:06.300 --> 06:06.970
GWARGH!

06:14.510 --> 06:15.640
YEEART!

06:15.640 --> 06:16.730
GWARGH!

06:23.520 --> 06:25.570
Fire! Shoot him right now!

06:25.570 --> 06:28.280
Screw you, asshole!

06:30.360 --> 06:31.240
YEEART!

06:33.780 --> 06:36.240
Screw you, asshole!

06:46.050 --> 06:49.550
AIYEAYEAYEAYEAYEAYEAYEARGH!

06:49.550 --> 06:50.220
YEEART!

06:50.220 --> 06:51.510
GWARGH!

06:53.220 --> 06:55.310
DŌZO, sir.

06:55.310 --> 06:58.060
Please tell me your floor.

07:03.860 --> 07:05.860
This is the Training Ground.

07:05.860 --> 07:09.150
Make it happen, or else!

07:09.150 --> 07:09.780
YEEART!

07:09.780 --> 07:11.660
SAYŌNARA!

07:15.490 --> 07:18.500
This is the Athletic Floor.

07:18.500 --> 07:19.330
YEEART!

07:19.330 --> 07:21.080
YEEART! YEEART!

07:21.080 --> 07:24.080
No AISATSU, Forest Sawatari-SAN?

07:24.080 --> 07:29.170
This is not SHITSUREI! It is an ambush, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

07:29.380 --> 07:31.510
What are you doing here?

07:31.510 --> 07:33.640
Have you become a dog of SŌKAIYA?

07:33.640 --> 07:37.890
I've already survived a week in this battlefield.

07:37.890 --> 07:39.560
I will not give you the treasure!

07:39.560 --> 07:40.560
Treasure?

07:40.560 --> 07:43.190
So you're simply here to steal something again?

07:43.190 --> 07:44.020
YEEART!

07:44.020 --> 07:46.060
Say whatever you please!

07:46.060 --> 07:46.480
YEEART!

07:47.650 --> 07:51.650
Something got SŌKAIYA riled up. Was it you?

07:51.650 --> 07:53.530
A prisoner?

07:54.530 --> 07:58.740
Which means... it's the Caucasoid woman who's always with you?

07:58.740 --> 08:01.290
I see. That explains it.

08:01.290 --> 08:03.120
Treasure and a beautiful woman!

08:03.120 --> 08:07.040
Twice the assets to acquire,
which means ten times the glory!

08:07.420 --> 08:10.210
I'll make that woman my bride!

08:11.880 --> 08:13.380
YEEART!

08:13.380 --> 08:16.430
I win, NINJA Slayer-SAN!

08:16.430 --> 08:18.050
YEEART!

08:18.050 --> 08:19.720
Farewell!

08:29.650 --> 08:31.740
This is the Battlefield.

08:33.150 --> 08:34.150
GWARGH!

08:34.990 --> 08:35.660
YEEART!

08:35.660 --> 08:37.120
GWAAAARRRGH!

08:37.870 --> 08:38.830
Fool!

08:38.830 --> 08:41.660
Fighting you isn't my priority right now!

08:41.660 --> 08:43.710
I'm taking the treasure and the woman!

08:47.790 --> 08:49.420
GWAAARGH!

08:57.340 --> 09:00.310
You made it up, huh? You're tough.

09:04.930 --> 09:06.100
Enemy sighted!

09:06.100 --> 09:08.690
New tactical enemy sighted.

09:08.690 --> 09:10.480
Priority set to AISATSU MODE.

09:10.480 --> 09:13.110
DŌMO. I am Motor DOKURO.

09:17.570 --> 09:19.990
A machine has no need of AISATSU.

09:19.990 --> 09:24.910
NINJA SOUL detected. This enemy has tested positive for NINJA.

09:24.910 --> 09:27.370
Exterminate! Exterminate! Exterminate!

09:27.370 --> 09:28.000
YEEART!

09:30.130 --> 09:32.670
I can't fight you right now.

09:32.670 --> 09:36.300
We'll finish after we defeat this new commie secret weapon!

09:36.300 --> 09:37.930
This is a battlefield.

09:37.930 --> 09:38.800
Very well!

09:38.800 --> 09:40.930
Exterminate! Exterminate!

09:40.930 --> 09:41.810
YEEART!

09:42.390 --> 09:43.520
GWAAAARGH!

09:49.060 --> 09:50.900
Exterminate! Exterminate!

09:50.900 --> 09:51.650
SAIGON!

09:51.650 --> 09:54.570
Beep beep boop! Beep beep boop!

09:51.650 --> 09:54.570
NOTE: This is NINJA COMPUTER LANGUAGE.

09:58.240 --> 10:00.320
The interruption is gone.

10:00.320 --> 10:01.910
Now it's your turn.

10:01.910 --> 10:02.660
Wait!

10:04.370 --> 10:05.160
YEEART!

10:05.160 --> 10:05.870
What?!

10:08.250 --> 10:10.670
DŌMO. I am Motor DOKURO.

10:10.670 --> 10:12.460
NINJA SOUL detected.

10:12.460 --> 10:14.500
Exterminate! Exterminate!

10:15.000 --> 10:15.880
YEEART!

10:15.880 --> 10:16.970
GWAAAAAAARGH!

10:16.970 --> 10:17.920
Exterminate!

10:17.920 --> 10:18.760
SAIGON!

10:18.760 --> 10:20.010
GWAAAAAARGH!

10:20.010 --> 10:23.180
YEEART!

10:23.180 --> 10:24.640
GWAAAAAARGH!

10:24.640 --> 10:25.600
Beep beep boop!

10:25.600 --> 10:26.890
Exterminate!

10:28.100 --> 10:28.850
YEEART!

10:28.850 --> 10:31.060
GWAAAAAARGH!

10:31.270 --> 10:32.480
YEEART!

10:32.810 --> 10:33.860
Beep beep boop!

10:33.860 --> 10:36.110
YEEEEAAAAAAARRRRRRRT!

10:36.570 --> 10:37.530
Beep beep boop!

10:37.530 --> 10:39.070
GWAAAAAAARGH!

10:46.370 --> 10:49.790
Okay, the commie reinforcements are gone.

10:50.710 --> 10:54.000
Time to finish this, NINJA—

10:55.800 --> 10:58.210
—Slayer-SAN...

10:58.510 --> 11:00.130
What?

11:00.130 --> 11:01.510
ᗅᗺᗷᗅ!

11:01.510 --> 11:04.220
His heart's on the left side of his chest?

11:04.220 --> 11:06.430
Then he suffered more than was necessary.

11:07.680 --> 11:12.400
Impossible! I would never let one of the Viet Cong get so close...

11:12.400 --> 11:13.560
Never...

11:13.560 --> 11:15.060
YEEART!

11:17.230 --> 11:19.240
GWAAAARGH!

11:28.330 --> 11:30.790
Just wait, my DŌJŌ!

11:30.790 --> 11:34.790
I'll bring you the treasure of HO CHI MINH!

11:30.790 --> 11:34.790
NOTE: HO CHI MINH is a PERSON who was not a NINJA.

11:34.790 --> 11:36.130
ᗅᗺᗷᗅ!

11:38.170 --> 11:40.300
DŌMO, Dark NINJA-SAN.

11:40.880 --> 11:43.680
It is time... for my revenge!

11:48.850 --> 11:51.480
DŌMO, NINJA Slayer-SAN.

11:53.730 --> 11:55.650
It has, indeed, been a while.
